    "headline": "Thunder Omens and Planetary Table",
    "text": "Omens of thunder and lightning from Ramadan 18 to Shawwal 24, forecasting prosperity for farmers, livestock sales, air confinement, disease, royal strength, justice, and Islam. A numerical table lists days, planets, planetary hours, maximum altitude, noon measurements, and foot-shadow values by zodiac sign."
